        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Extracurricular activity for supplements for service clubs and interest clubs which meet outside the regular student day shall be provided. Service club activities must have a minimum of twenty (20) participants, and interest club activities must have a minimum of ten (10) participants, based on average attendance, to qualify for a unit. Exceptions to the minimum number of participants must be approved by the Program Consultant for Extracurricular Activities or his designee. Students shall be made aware of what day(s) they will be participating. The teacher who receives the supplement shall have on file in the principal's office special club or activity information.",
